                                  <node index="6" text="This is insane. This is seriously ridiculous.&#10;&#10;Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei was asked what a young person who just graduated from high school should do today.&#10;&#10;His answer:&#10;&#10;“AI can already do junior lawyer work. Junior financial analyst work. Junior consultant work.&#10;We can’t deny that it will also eliminate jobs, and possibly a lot of them.”&#10;&#10;In a few minutes, he listed the jobs that will disappear first, and the skill that will keep you in the game.&#10;&#10;His advice boils down to one sentence:&#10;&#10;“Obviously, learn to use AI.”&#10;&#10;People who start learning this year won’t compete with AI: they’ll be the ones directing AI.&#10;&#10;All of the following are free. Start today:&#10;&#10;1. Anthropic - Interactive prompt engineering tutorial: the fastest way to learn how to direct models.&#10;github.com/anthropics/pro…&#10;&#10;2. Anthropic course: from your first prompt to managing agents.&#10;github.com/anthropics/cou…&#10;&#10;3. Anthropic Cookbook: practical recipes you can copy today.&#10;github.com/anthropics/ant…&#10;&#10;4. Microsoft - Generative AI for Beginners: 21 lessons, no degree required.&#10;github.com/microsoft/gene…&#10;&#10;5. Microsoft - AI Agents for Beginners: build agents that do junior-level work for you.&#10;github.com/microsoft/ai-a…&#10;&#10;6. Hugging Face - Agents Course: free and comes with a certificate, from zero to a complete setup.&#10;github.com/huggingface/ag…&#10;&#10;7. Google Cloud - Generative AI: hands-on notebooks from Google.&#10;github.com/GoogleCloudPla…&#10;&#10;8. OpenAI Cookbook: code for common tasks.&#10;github.com/openai/openai-…&#10;&#10;9. DAIR.AI - Prompt engineering guide: the guide everyone is sharing.&#10;github.com/dair-ai/Prompt…&#10;&#10;10. Andrej Karpathy - Neural Networks: Zero to Hero: understand the fundamentals.&#10;github.com/karpathy/nn-ze…&#10;&#10;11. CrewAI: get your own team of AI employees up and running.&#10;github.com/crewAIInc/crew…&#10;&#10;12. Microsoft - AutoGen: get multiple agents working together on the same task.&#10;github.com/microsoft/auto…&#10;&#10;13. Awesome LLM Apps: hundreds of hands-on projects to learn from.&#10;github.com/Shubhamsaboo/a…&#10;&#10;14. DeepLearning.AI - Short courses: free one-hour courses taught by subject-matter experts.&#10;deeplearning.ai/short-courses&#10;&#10;15. Anthropic: AI Fluency with Claude&#10;imp.i384100.net/9Vyr33&#10;&#10;16. Anthropic: AI Automation with Claude&#10;imp.i384100.net/E0RWXK&#10;&#10;17. Anthropic: AI Collaboration with Claude&#10;imp.i384100.net/JkRaN2&#10;&#10;18. Anthropic: Developing with the Claude API&#10;imp.i384100.net/n4WzQV&#10;&#10;19. Anthropic Model Context Protocol: Advanced Topics&#10;imp.i384100.net/3km3Nr&#10;&#10;20. Anthropic Teaches AI Fluency&#10;imp.i384100.net/R02X9X&#10;&#10;21. Anthropic: Real-World AI Specialization for Everyone&#10;imp.i384100.net/AgBqn1&#10;&#10;22. Claude AI for Marketing&#10;imp.i384100.net/enkbGz&#10;&#10;23. Learn Claude from Scratch&#10;imp.i384100.net/AgRGD7&#10;&#10;24. Claude Code: Software Engineering with Generative AI Agents&#10;imp.i384100.net/OeGoDn&#10;&#10;Total cost: €0.&#10;&#10;You don’t need another year of school to learn all this. What you need is to start telling AI what to do.&#10;&#10;95% of people will finish school and then compete with AI for the same junior positions.&#10;&#10;The 5% who learn to direct AI this year will manage the agents doing that work.&#10;&#10;Save this post and share it with anyone graduating this year." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.twitter.android" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" visible-to-user="true" bounds="[176,1080][1047,2340]" drawing-order="6" hint="" display-id="0"/>
